UPDATE companies SET description='Electramatic was founded in 1963 in Northeast Minneapolis, Minnesota, where it operates a 40,000-square-foot facility. The company began as a supplier of electrical cable assemblies and has expanded its footprint and capabilities over six decades.

It functions as a contract manufacturer specializing in electrical wire harnesses and electro‑mechanical assemblies. Core processes include cutting, stripping, terminating, marking, soldering, twisting, braiding, tubing, injection molding, and ultrasonic welding. The facility handles wire gauges from 30 AWG to 4/0 and offers wire dyeing and striping with up to three stripes per wire in a full color spectrum, including insulation dying on PVC wire.

Electramatic serves a broad range of industries, citing over eighty customers in sectors such as commercial refrigeration and industrial generator‑set harnesses.

The company emphasizes responsiveness and proactive problem‑solving, aiming to be the most responsive supplier of electrical cable assemblies in the Midwest.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','IPC/WHMA‑A‑620']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire cutting", "Wire stripping", "Wire terminating", "Wire marking", "Seal application", "Wire twisting", "Wire braiding", "Soldering", "Tubing", "Injection molding", "Ultrasonic welding", "General assembly", "Harness assembly", "Electro\u2011mechanical assembly", "Harness braiding", "Engineering support", "Wire dyeing", "Wire striping", "Insulation dying on PVC wire", "Large cable processing (8 AWG to 4/0)", "Multi\u2011conductor wire processing", "Automated wire processing (30 AWG to 10 AWG)"], "industries": ["Commercial refrigeration", "Industrial genset harnesses"], "materials": ["PVC wire"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1963 -> /about", "Headquartered in Minneapolis, Minnesota -> / and /about", "40,000 sq ft facility in Northeast Minneapolis -> /about", "Contract manufacturer of electrical wire harness and electro-mechanical assembly -> /about and db", "Processes: cutting, terminating, injection molding, twisting, braiding, soldering, marking, tubing -> /about", "Wire processing capabilities: automated wire processing 30 AWG to 10 AWG, large cable 8 AWG to 4/0 -> /capabilities", "Wire dyeing and striping up to three stripes per wire, insulation dying on PVC wire -> /capabilities", "ISO 9001:2015 registered -> /about and /quality", "IPC/WHMA-A-620 standard compliance -> /about and /quality", "Serves over 80 customers in industries including commercial refrigeration and industrial genset harnesses -> /", "Vision: most responsive supplier of electrical cable assemblies in the Midwest -> / and /about", "DPPM and on-time delivery metrics tracked on production floor -> /about and /quality"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop"