UPDATE companies SET description='Electric Wire Products Corporation (EWP) was established in 1957 in the Minneapolis–Saint Paul metropolitan area of Minnesota. The company operates a 75,000‑square‑foot production facility in St. Louis Park, Minnesota, and maintains an additional manufacturing site in China.

EWP manufactures custom wire harnesses, electromechanical assemblies (including control panels and power distribution units), custom cable assemblies, and provides kitting and packaging services. The St. Louis Park plant houses an extensive, highly trained workforce and uses what the company describes as state‑of‑the‑art equipment.

The company serves customers nationwide across industries such as turf management, utility vehicles, industrial equipment, power sports vehicles, construction equipment, automotive, factory maintenance equipment, and agricultural sectors. Its assemblies are used in applications ranging from control panels to power distribution units.

