UPDATE companies SET description='Elevation Foods operates from Knoxville, Tennessee, with a second manufacturing facility in Danvers, Massachusetts. The company does not publicly disclose its founding year, ownership structure, or founders. It describes itself as a team of food-passionate, highly-collaborative, entrepreneurial business leaders combining a decades-long track record of food marketing and manufacturing with culinary, chef-created food concepts.

The company produces savory baked goods such as quiches and chicken pot pies, dips and spreads, deli salads, and ready-to-eat sous vide potatoes. Its manufacturing capabilities include kettle cooking, baking, mixing, and filling for both refrigerated and frozen products, with packaging formats ranging from single-serve retail to bulk foodservice sizes. Two redundant facilities in Knoxville and Danvers provide national and regional supply coverage.

Elevation Foods serves retail and foodservice channels, working with grocery and club retailers, as well as foodservice operators such as delis, sandwich bars, and hot bars. The company offers contract manufacturing and private label services, developing custom products for brands and retailers across its core categories.

The company emphasizes food safety and consistency, noting daily USDA inspection, SQF certification, HACCP compliance, and third-party audits. Its stated differentiation lies in culinary-inspired concepts that challenge traditional prepared food paradigms, delivered through collaborative R&D and culinary teams that scale customer recipes without compromise.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF certified','HACCP compliant','FDA governed']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Kettle cooking", "Baking", "Mixing", "Filling", "Refrigerated production", "Frozen production", "Packaging (single-serve to bulk)", "Culinary development", "R&D and commercialization", "Contract manufacturing", "Private label production", "Sous vide potato preparation", "Quiche and frittata production", "Chicken pot pie production", "Deli salad production", "Dip and spread production"], "industries": ["Retail", "Foodservice", "Grocery", "Club retail", "Deli", "Sandwich bars", "Hot bars"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Redundant manufacturing facilities in Knoxville, TN and Danvers, MA", "Daily USDA inspection, SQF certified, HACCP compliant", "Contract manufacturing and private label services", "Culinary and R&D teams for custom product development", "Kettle cooking, baking, mixing, and filling for refrigerated and frozen products"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Knoxville, Tennessee -> db", "Second facility: Danvers, MA -> /about", "Founding year not disclosed -> /about", "Ownership not disclosed -> /about", "Founders not disclosed -> /about", "Team description: food-passionate, highly-collaborative, entrepreneurial business leaders combining a decades-long track record of food marketing and manufacturing with culinary, chef-created food concepts -> /about", "Products: quiches, chicken pot pies, dips & spreads, deli salads, ready-to-eat potatoes -> /about, /", "Capabilities: kettle cooking, baking, mixing, filling, refrigerated, frozen, p