UPDATE companies SET description='Emco Industrial Plastics operates from Cedar Grove, New Jersey. The company’s injection molding division has been manufacturing components since 1988. All molds are designed internally by the company’s own staff and are produced entirely in the United States.

It also offers CNC machining, CNC routing, laser cutting, plastic welding, edge finishing, forming, polishing, drape and oven forming, vacuum forming, sealing and gaskets, and plastic cut-to-size services. The company works with a wide range of engineering plastics including acetal, acrylic, Celtec, Corzan, Delrin, Ertalyte, fiberglass, GPO, HDPE, Hydlar, Kydex, Kynar, Nylatron, nylon, PEEK, and PETG.

Emco serves industries such as aerospace, alternative energy, automotive, building and construction, chemical processing, electrical, fluid handling, food and beverage, heavy equipment, marine, medical, oil and gas, packaging machinery, semiconductor, and water and wastewater treatment. The company also supplies OEM replacement parts.

Emco emphasizes end-to-end project management, following each job from inception through design, assembly, testing, re-testing, decoration, packaging, and shipment. Its molds are designed in-house and made in the USA, and the company highlights its long-standing injection molding experience since 1988.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection Molding", "Custom Fabrication", "Value-Added Services", "Foam Cell PVC Machining, Fabricating & Distribution", "Acetal Machining & Fabricating", "Acrylic Machining & Fabricating", "Celtec Machining & Fabricating", "Corzan Machining & Fabricating", "Delrin Machining & Fabrication", "Ertalyte Machining & Fabrication", "Fiberglass Machining & Fabrication", "GPO Machining & Fabrication", "HDPE Machining & Fabricating", "Hydlar Machining & Fabrication", "Kydex Machining & Fabrication", "Kynar Machining & Fabrication", "Nylatron Machining & Fabrication", "Nylon Machining & Fabrication", "PEEK Machining Fabricating", "PETG Machining & Fabrication", "CNC Machining", "CNC Routing", "Laser Cutting", "Plastic Welding"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Aerospace California", "Alternative Energy", "Automotive", "Building & Construction", "Chemical Processing", "Electrical", "Fluid Handling", "Food & Beverage Industry", "Heavy Equipment", "Marine", "Medical Grade Plastic", "Oil & Gas", "Packaging Machine Manufacturing", "Semiconductor", "Water & Wastewater"], "materials": ["Acetal", "Acrylic", "Celtec", "Corzan", "Delrin", "Ertalyte", "Fiberglass", "GPO", "HDPE", "Hydlar", "Kydex", "Kynar", "Nylatron", "Nylon", "PEEK", "PETG", "Polycarbonate", "ABS", "PTFE", "UHMW PE", "PVC", "CPVC"], "equipment": ["Injection molding machines (30\u2013550 ton)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Molds designed internally by own staff, 100% made in USA", "Injection molding machines from 30 to 550 ton capacity", "Full project follow-through from inception to shipment", "In-house design, assembly, test, 