UPDATE companies SET description='Epic Steel is a family-owned metal roofing and siding manufacturer based in Missoula, Montana. The company describes itself as locally owned and committed to quality service and products, with decades of experience in the steel industry.

The company produces a full line of metal building components, including roofing and siding panels, standard trim, soffit, fasteners, accessories, underlayment, and snow retention systems. All materials are domestically sourced and manufactured in the United States. Epic Steel also offers recycled steel options and eco-friendly paint finishes that meet Energy Star partner standards.

The company emphasizes its deep familiarity with Montana''s climate as a key differentiator, stating that its materials are engineered to withstand the state''s changing conditions. Epic Steel also highlights its complete stock of essential accessories, commitment to domestically sourced steel, and environmentally conscious finishes as reasons customers choose them.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Metal roofing panel manufacturing", "Metal siding panel manufacturing", "Custom trim fabrication", "Soffit manufacturing", "Fastener supply", "Accessory manufacturing", "Underlayment supply", "Snow retention system manufacturing", "Custom metal fabrication to specification", "Eco-friendly paint finishing (Energy Star partner standards)"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Agricultural construction", "Custom metal fabrication", "Metal roofing", "Metal siding"], "materials": ["Domestically sourced steel", "Recycled steel", "Eco-friendly paint finishes (Energy Star partner standards)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and locally operated in Missoula, Montana", "Domestically sourced steel manufactured in the USA", "Recycled materials and eco-friendly paint finishes meeting Energy Star partner standards", "Complete stock of essential accessories for metal roofing and siding", "Materials engineered for Montana''s climate conditions"], "facts_used": ["Family-owned business located in Missoula, Montana -> /about", "Metal roofing and siding manufacturer with domestically sourced materials -> /", "Offers recycled materials and eco-friendly paint finishes meeting Energy Star partner standards -> /about", "Products include panels, trim, soffit, fasteners, accessories, underlayment, snow retention systems -> /", "Decades of experience in steel industry -> /about", "Serves residential and commercial contractors, custom home builders, agricultural operations ->