UPDATE companies SET description='Ethos Furniture operates from Colorado Springs, Colorado, where it produces custom-built furniture and tables. The company sells directly through its website, offering pieces such as the Sequoia Dining Table, inspired by the columnar form of giant sequoias, and the Easton Sideboard, a client favorite. No founding year, ownership details, or founder names are disclosed in public materials.

