UPDATE companies SET description='Evolution Furniture operates from Naperville, Illinois, serving the Chicago metropolitan area with custom furniture fabrication, restoration, and design services. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure on its website.

The shop provides end-to-end custom furniture services: fabrication, restoration, upholstery, custom painting, and repair. A five-step process—Define, Discover, Design, Develop, Deliver—guides projects from initial conversation through 3D renderings, material selection, and final handcrafted production. The team manages sourcing, production, delivery, assembly, and placement for orders ranging from single pieces to large commercial installations.

Clients include commercial businesses, residential homeowners, and interior designers. Notable projects comprise the Uber Headquarters, Chicago Bears Halas Hall, Mondelez International offices, and the 1326 S Michigan development. The firm partners with the American Society of Interior Designers (ASID) and services suburbs such as Glencoe, Barrington, Winnetka, and Oak Brook.

Evolution Furniture emphasizes hands-on project management and on-time, on-budget delivery. Its differentiators include a collaborative design approach that incorporates architecture and fashion inspiration, skilled craftsmen executing detailed technical drawings, and a single-source responsibility for design, fabrication, and installation.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture fabrication", "Furniture restoration", "Upholstery", "Custom painted furniture", "Furniture repair", "Custom design (3D renderings, sketches, models)", "Project management (sourcing, production, delivery, assembly, placement)"], "industries": ["Commercial", "Residential", "Interior Design", "Corporate Offices", "Hospitality", "Sports Facilities", "Food & Beverage"], "materials": ["Solid wood", "Wood veneer", "Laminate", "Wood finishes", "Upholstery fabrics", "Custom paints"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Hands-on project management from design approval through delivery, assembly, and placement", "Five-step collaborative design process (Define, Discover, Design, Develop, Deliver)", "Single-source responsibility for custom fabrication, restoration, upholstery, painting, and repair", "Partnership with the American Society of Interior Designers (ASID)", "Service across the Chicago metropolitan area for both commercial and residential clients"], "facts_used": ["Location: Naperville, IL -> db and /", "Custom furniture fabrication, restoration, upholstery, painting, repair services -> /", "Five-step design process (Define, Discover, Design, Develop, Deliver) -> /", "Notable projects: Uber Headquarters, Chicago Bears Halas Hall, Mondelez International, 1326 S Michigan -> /", "Service area: Chicago metropolitan area (list of suburbs) -> /", "Partnership with ASID -> /", "Hands-on project management from design through installation -> /", "Materials: solid wood, veneer, laminate, wood finishes, upholstery fabric