UPDATE companies SET description='Evolution St. Louis operates a high-tech knitting facility in St. Louis, Missouri. The company builds on the city’s deep fashion-industry heritage to create what it calls the apparel manufacturing and supply chain facility of the future, focusing on advanced flat-bed knitting technology and the creation of new U.S. manufacturing jobs.

The facility runs STOLL ADF and CMS knit and wear® machines capable of 3D and complete-garment seamless knitting. It produces fully fashioned knits, sweaters knit to shape, footwear, smart textiles, and technical textiles, achieving complex geometries with minimal waste. Services include product engineering, prototyping, material sourcing and development, technology integration, IP protection, and testing, with small-batch runs enabled by short setup times. Linking, sewing, finishing, labeling, barcoding, and hangtag application are also offered in-house.

The company serves brands and retailers across apparel, footwear, accessories, technical and smart textiles, automotive, aerospace, home and furniture, lifestyle, sports, health and wellness, medical technology, and public-safety sectors such as medical, police, fire, and transit.

Evolution St. Louis was started to revitalize the domestic knit industry, allowing American brands to keep pace with emerging trends and positioning St. Louis as a hub for advanced knitting and manufacturing.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["3D knitting", "Complete garment seamless knitting", "Fully fashioned knitting", "Sweater knitting (knit to shape)", "Footwear knitting", "Smart textiles production", "Technical textiles production", "Complex shape knitting with minimal waste", "Small batch production", "Product engineering", "Prototyping", "Material sourcing", "Material development", "Technology integration", "IP protection", "Testing", "Linking, sewing and finishing", "Labeling, barcoding and hangtag application"], "industries": ["Apparel", "Footwear", "Accessories", "Technical Textiles", "Smart Textiles", "Automotive", "Aerospace", "Home & Furniture", "Lifestyle", "Sports", "Health & Wellness", "Medical Technology", "Medical", "Police", "Fire", "Transit"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["STOLL ADF knit and wear\u00ae machines", "STOLL CMS knit and wear\u00ae machines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["3D and complete-garment seamless knitting on STOLL ADF/CMS machines", "Small-batch production with short setup times", "Complex shapes with minimal material waste", "In-house product engineering, prototyping, and material development", "Integrated IP protection and testing services"], "facts_used": ["Location: St. Louis, Missouri -> db", "High-tech knitting facility with 3D and complete garment seamless knitting technology -> db", "Uses STOLL ADF and CMS knit and wear\u00ae machines -> /capabilities", "Produces fully fashioned knits, sweaters knit to shape, footwear, smart textiles, technical textiles -> /capabilities", "Services: product engineering, prototyping, material sourcing, material development, technology integration, IP protection, testing -> /capabilities", "Small batch capabilities thanks to