UPDATE companies SET description='Excel Injection Molding was founded in 1995 by John Robinson, CEO, and Randy White, Plant Manager, in Hattiesburg, Mississippi. The company began with 12 employees, six presses, and a 6,000‑square‑foot building.

Today the firm operates a 45,000‑square‑foot, Class A facility in the Hattiesburg Mississippi Industrial Park, running 21 presses with a staff of over 60. It provides end‑to‑end product development — design, manufacturability analysis, CAD support, material selection, tooling design and construction, prototyping, and production — along with scientific injection molding, in‑house tooling, and secondary operations such as assembly, decorating, machining, and custom automation fixtures.

The company serves a diversified customer base across electrical, water filtration, appliance, lawn and garden, medical, lighting, consumer products, building and construction, and recreational industries. Many of its original clients remain active partners, reflecting a focus on long‑term relationships.

Excel was established to give customers a competitive advantage through exceptional quality, reliable on‑time delivery, and fair pricing — a founding objective that still guides daily operations.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Product design", "Design for manufacturability analysis", "CAD support", "Material selection", "Tooling design", "Tool building", "Prototyping", "Injection molding", "Scientific molding", "Automation", "Assembly", "Decorating", "Machining", "Post\u2011molding operations", "Custom equipment and fixture building"], "industries": ["Electrical", "Water filtration", "Appliance", "Lawn and garden", "Medical", "Lighting", "Consumer products", "Building and construction", "Recreational products"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Scientific molding principles for quality and repeatability", "In\u2011house tooling design and build capability", "Secondary operations integrated at the press to reduce handling", "Custom automation fixtures and equipment built internally"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1995 by John Robinson and Randy White -> /about", "Started with 12 employees, 6 presses, 6,000 sq ft building -> /about", "Current facility 45,000 sq ft, Class A, 21 presses, over 60 employees -> /about", "Industries served: electrical, water filtration, appliance, lawn & garden, medical, lighting, consumer products, building & construction, recreational products -> /", "Services: product development, injection molding, tooling/molds, secondary operations -> /services", "Scientific molding, automation, best manufacturing practices, continuous improvement -> /services", "In-house tooling operation and strategic mold building partners -> /services", "Secondary operations: assembly, decorating, machining, custom equipment/fixtures -> /services", "Founding objective: best value through exceptional quality, service, on-time delivery, competitive price -> /about", "Long-te