UPDATE companies SET description='Fabric Hawaii, operated by Muumuu Rainbow, is based in Honolulu, Hawaii. The business began in 2013 as a Hawaiian dress rental company before evolving into an experiential fabric store with a physical location in Waikiki and an online shop.

The company stocks a vibrant selection of cotton, knit jersey, rayon, and exclusive Hawaiian print fabrics suited for quilting, garment sewing, home decor, and general crafting. Beyond retail, it offers original fabric creation services, a start-up support program for emerging craft businesses, and hands-on block printing workshops where participants design their own prints. The store also sells finished goods such as dog apparel and reusable gift-wrapping fabrics.

Customers range from hobbyist quilters and sewers to small-scale crafters building product lines. During the COVID-19 pandemic, the company supplied affordable fabric for mask-making and donated masks and kits to the community.

Founded on the Hawaiian principle of kokua — help and care — Fabric Hawaii aims to preserve traditional prints while fostering creative connection. The blend of curated fabrics, custom design services, and cultural workshops distinguishes it as a community-oriented fabric destination rather than a conventional supplier.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Start-up support service", "Block printing workshops", "Custom fabric design and printing", "Fabric retail and wholesale", "Finished goods sewing (dog apparel, furoshiki)", "Fabric scrap sales by weight"], "industries": ["Quilting", "Apparel", "Home Decor", "Crafts", "Medical (mask making)", "Pet Apparel", "Gift Wrapping"], "materials": ["Cotton", "Knit jersey", "Rayon"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Exclusive Hawaiian print fabrics curated for quilting, apparel, and decor", "Block printing workshops enabling custom fabric design", "Original fabric creation and start-up support for craft businesses", "Community-focused mission rooted in the Hawaiian spirit of kokua", "Free shipping on domestic orders over $80"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Honolulu, Hawaii -> /", "Founded in 2013 as a Hawaiian dress rental company -> /about-us", "Operated by Muumuu Rainbow -> /about-us", "Offers cotton, knit jersey, rayon, and exclusive Hawaiian print fabrics -> /", "Provides original fabric creation services and start-up support -> /", "Runs block printing workshops -> /", "Sells finished goods including dog apparel and furoshiki gift wraps -> /", "Serves hobbyists, business crafters, quilters, and mask makers -> /, /about-us", "Donated masks and kits during COVID-19 -> /about-us", "Mission rooted in Hawaiian kokua spirit -> /, /about-us", "Free shipping on orders over $80 USA -> /", "Physical store in Waikiki -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "unclear", "type_evidence": "FabricHawaii, operated by Muumuu Rainbow, began its journey