UPDATE companies SET description='Feast Detroit operates from Inkster, Michigan. The company was founded by a group of small food entrepreneurs, including cofounders Amit Makhecha and Scott Owens, with guidance from Eastern Market. Eastern Market recognized a need for a facility to help small food brands scale production beyond shared-use kitchens.

Feast Detroit provides contract manufacturing and private-label services for specialty food products. Its 16,000-square-foot climate-controlled facility offers shelf-stable hot-fill (acidified and acid), ambient-fill (dry and liquid pack), and cold-fill modified-atmosphere packaging lines. The company also operates a shared-use kitchen and an e-commerce fulfillment service. To date, it supports more than 40 brands and produces over 100 SKUs.

The client base consists of small and medium-sized food brands seeking to increase production volumes without the high minimum orders typical of traditional co-packers. Feast Detroit produces items such as salsas, chutneys, hot sauces, BBQ sauces, salad dressings, pickles, mustards, popped snacks, spice blends, pasta sauces, soups, and ready-to-eat entrées.

The company differentiates itself with low minimum order quantities, an average lead time of about three weeks, third-party GMP certification, FDA registration for acidified foods, and a Michigan Department of Agriculture and Rural Development license.', certifications=ARRAY['GMP','MDARD license']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Shelf-stable hot fill (acidified)", "Shelf-stable hot fill (acid)", "Ambient fill (dry pack)", "Ambient fill (liquid pack)", "Cold fill (modified atmosphere packaging)", "Shared-use kitchen rental", "E-commerce fulfillment", "Contract manufacturing", "Private label production", "Test kitchen access"], "industries": ["Specialty food products", "Small and medium food brands", "Acidified food production", "Local food brands"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Average 3 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Low minimum order quantities", "Average lead time of three weeks", "Third-party GMP certification", "FDA registered for acidified food production", "16,000 sq ft climate-controlled facility"], "facts_used": ["Location: Inkster, Michigan -> db", "Founders: Amit Makhecha, Scott Owens -> /about-us", "Founded by small food entrepreneurs with Eastern Market guidance -> /about-us", "Facility size: 16,000 sq ft climate-controlled -> /services", "Supports over 40 companies, 100+ SKUs -> /about-us", "Processes: shelf-stable hot fill (acidified, acid), ambient fill (dry, liquid), cold fill (MAP) -> /services", "Shared-use kitchen and e-commerce fulfillment -> /services", "Low MOQ -> /", "Average lead time 3 weeks -> /", "Third-party GMP certification -> /", "FDA registered for acidified foods -> /services", "MDARD licensed -> /services", "Products: salsas, chutneys, hot sauces, etc. -> /services"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Contract manufacturer for Specialty food products", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "Lo