UPDATE companies SET description='Five Rivers Fabrication was established in 2020 in Easton, Pennsylvania, by a father-and-son team with a combined 30 years of industry experience.

The company provides structural steel fabrication, commercial signage, railings, custom fabrication, and home decor items. Operating from a single facility in Easton, it serves both project-based clients and an online store that sells finished pieces such as wall art and bottle openers. Specific facility size, headcount, and annual volume are not disclosed.

The firm has produced signage and fabricated steel for a veterans’ nonprofit called Battle Borne, as well as custom pieces for electrical contractors and home decor clients across the region.

