UPDATE companies SET description='Floating Axe Woodworks operates in Rockford, Michigan, where it runs a small wood and wood furniture business. The company does not publish a founding year or ownership structure, but presents itself as a locally rooted operation focused on hardwoods sourced from Michigan forests.

