UPDATE companies SET description='Florida Natural Flavors operates from a 32,000-square-foot facility in Casselberry, Florida. The company was founded in 1982 by Dave Erdman, who remains president, and it has remained family-owned since its inception. Erdman’s original goal was to supply distributors with high-quality beverage mixes that are easy to use, easy to store, and deliver strong profit margins.

The manufacturer produces fruit- and juice-based beverage mixes, soda syrups, frozen drinks, daiquiri mixes, smoothies, juice concentrates, and bag-in-box products. Its plant runs batches of 1,000 to 3,000 gallons and includes an in-house laboratory for quality control and an on-site label printing operation.

Customers include beverage distributors, restaurants, bars, hotels, resorts, theme parks, convenience stores, cruise lines, and all-inclusive resorts. The company’s products are served globally in venues such as theme parks, cruise ships, and hospitality groups, and it also supplies cafés and food-service operators.

Florida Natural Flavors emphasizes its singular focus on beverages as a differentiator, citing over 100 years of collective team experience and certifications including GSFI, HACCP, and Kosher (Florida-K). The company highlights fast turnaround on both stock and custom orders, rush-order accommodation, and a family-oriented approach to customer service.', certifications=ARRAY['GSFI Certified','NRFSP Certified','OSHA Trained and Certified','HACCP Food Safety Program','Kosher Certified (Florida-K)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Contract beverage packaging", "Private label beverage manufacturing", "Product development and flavor matching", "Bag-in-box packaging (2.5, 3, 5 gallon)", "Bottling (1/2 gallon 6-pack, 1 gallon 4-pack)", "In-house label printing", "Blending and quality control", "Beverage formulation", "Turn-key packaging, development, and labeling", "Contract manufacturing", "Custom formulation"], "industries": ["Beverage distributors", "Restaurants", "Bars", "Hotels", "Resorts", "Theme parks", "Hospitality groups", "Convenience stores", "Cruise lines", "All-inclusive resorts", "Caf\u00e9s", "Food service"], "materials": ["Fruit juices", "Citrus", "Natural flavors", "Juice concentrates"], "equipment": ["In-house laboratory", "On-site label printing facility"], "volume": "Batch sizes of 1,000\u20133,000 gallons", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["32,000 sq ft facility with batch capacity of 1,000\u20133,000 gallons", "In-house laboratory and on-site label printing for fast turnaround", "Family-owned with over 100 years of collective beverage industry experience", "GSFI certified, HACCP compliant, and Kosher (Florida-K) certified", "Guaranteed fast turnaround on stock and custom products, with rush-order flexibility"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1982 -> /about-us", "Founder Dave Erdman -> /about-us", "Family-owned -> /about-us", "Facility 32,000 sq ft -> /services", "Batch capacity 1,000\u20133,000 gallons -> /services", "In-house laboratory